 "title": "Welcome to Ellsworth County, KS",
 "text": "Welcome to Ellsworth County, KS\nGO\nSearch\nHome\nGovernment\nCounty Attorney\nCounty Commissioners\nCounty Clerk\nDistrict Court\nCounty Register of Deeds\nSheriff's Office\nCo Treasurer - DMV & Property Tax\nDepartments\nAppraisers\nEconomic Development\nEmergency Management\nEMS\nMidway Extension District 15\nHealth Department\nRoad and Bridge\nResidents\nArchives\nCounty Information\nElections\nCounty Bulletin Board\nMajor Employers\nNoxious Weed & Landfill\nRecycling\nTownships\nNews & Job Openings\nELLSWORTH COUNTY\n2022 Comprehensive Vision Plan\nLearn More\nProperty Tax\nLearn More\nCrisis & Emergency Services\nLearn More\nLevy Sheets\nLearn More\nExplore our\nCounty\nLIVE\nWORK\nPLAY\nNews &\nAnnouncements\nEllsworth County Appraiser Department is hiring!\nEllsworth County Highway Department is hiring!\nRequest for a Construction Manager At-Risk (CMAR)\nView All News\nAbout Us\nEllsworthCounty.org is the official web site for Ellsworth County, Kansas. The purpose of EllsworthCounty.org is to provide the people of Ellsworth County with news and information. On this web site you can find information for many departments in the courthouse as well as general information on Ellsworth County.\nEllsworth County is located in north-central Kansas, and includes the cities of Ellsworth, Holyrood, Kanopolis, Lorraine, and Wilson. The county seat is Ellsworth. Ellsworth County also includes Kanopolis Reservoir, Fort Harker Museum, Hogden House Museum, the annual Czech Festival in Wilson, and more.\nAs of 2010, the population of Ellsworth County, KS, was 6,483. Ellsworth County covers approximately 717 square miles. Please go to our Ellsworth County Information page for more detailed information and statistics about Ellsworth County, KS.\n© 2017 Ellsworth County, KS\n210 N Kansas Ave Ellsworth KS 67439\nPowered By\nRevize\nLogin\n×\nShare this page\nCopy and past this code into your website.\n<a href=\"http://ellsworthcounty.org/\">Your Link Name</a>\nShare this page on your favorite Social network\nFacebook\nTwitter\nGoogle Plus\nReddit\nClose",
